<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns BB rating to Mexico samurai bonds.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns BB rating to Mexico samurai bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp said on Monday it had assigned a BB rating to 70 billion yen worth of samurai bonds issued by Mexico.</p>
<p>The bonds mature on September 30, 2002.</p>
</text>
